  "metadata": {
    "test": {
      "height": 512,
      "width": 512,
      "description": "Fill-extrusions behind rising terrain: the terrain and the buildings share one depth, so a slope between the camera and a building hides it. Before, the terrain and fill-extrusions were projected with different near planes (and, on Metal/Vulkan/WebGPU, only the terrain's clip z was remapped to [0, 1]), and buildings behind slopes were drawn over them."
    }
